A stratified train-test split was used to preserve the class distribution. Accuracy was not considered alone; precision, recall, F1-score, and ROC-AUC were also evaluated.

Machine Learning Models

Decision Tree Classifier

Configuration:

max_depth = 5

random_state = 42

The Decision Tree was selected because it is relatively easy to interpret and provides feature importance through feature_importances_.

Logistic Regression

Configuration:

max_iter = 1000

random_state = 42

Logistic Regression was used as an interpretable baseline for binary classification.

