Comparison

Logistic Regression achieved better overall accuracy, precision, and ROC-AUC. The Decision Tree achieved slightly higher recall and nearly the same F1-score. For this experiment, Logistic Regression was the stronger overall model, while the Decision Tree offered better rule-based interpretability and feature-importance analysis.

